<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S4" title="In Agentic Aerial Cinematography:From Dialogue Cues to Cinematic Trajectories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">IV </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Experiment</span></span></a>
